      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠳᠠᠯᠠᠪᠴᠢ ~ ᠳᠠᠯᠠᠪᠴᠢᠨ</unicode>
      <uighur>dalabči - dalabčin</uighur>
      <cyrillic>далавч(ин)</cyrillic>
      <transcript>DALABCI(N)</transcript>
      <definition>n. Wing[s]; anything resembling or suggestive of wings; blade of an oar or a propeller, fins of fish, etc. Cf. dalubci.</definition>
      <page>223</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠯᠠᠪᠴᠢ ᠳᠡᠯᠭᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- delgeky</transcript>
          <definition> To spread the wings.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠢᠭᠠᠰᠤᠨ ᠤ ᠳᠠᠯᠠᠪᠴᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>ziγasun u – </transcript>
          <definition>Fins of fish</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
